meta {
  name: Accurate Connection
  seq: 1
}

docs {
  Connecting mr-twin-backend to Accurate Online. "1. Connect" and its
  callback stay unauthenticated by design (full-page browser redirect,
  can't carry a Bearer token — the real gate is Accurate's own login).
  Steps 2-4 read/change connection state and require an admin token —
  run Admin > Login first and this folder's requests will pick up
  {{admin_token}} automatically.

  Flow order: Connect (browser) → List Databases → Select Database →
  Connection Status.
}
